      "description": "Harvard University is a prestigious private Ivy League university in the United States. The meme falsely claims the child has been 'accepted into Harvard' as a cruel joke, leveraging the real-world prestige and exclusivity associated with the institution to mock the child's perceived intellectual limitations.",
