      "instance_name": "retard",
      "label": "Slur 'retard'",
      "description": "The term 'retard' is a derogatory slur historically used to demean individuals with developmental disabilities. It is a form of ableism and is considered deeply offensive and harmful. The meme uses this slur to dehumanize the child and reinforce negative stereotypes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
