      "instance_name": "intelligence_mockery",
      "label": "Intelligence Mockery",
      "description": "The meme uses the false claim that the child 'can't even read' to mock his intelligence, which is a common form of ableist mockery. This stereotype implies that individuals with developmental disabilities are intellectually inferior and incapable of academic achievement.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_46ff989e"
