      "instance_name": "developmental_disabilities",
      "label": "Developmental Disabilities",
      "description": "Developmental disabilities are a group of conditions that affect cognitive, physical, or social functioning, often present from childhood. The meme targets this group by using the child's visible disability as a basis for cruel, false claims and derogatory language.",
