      "label": "Laughing Out Loud (LMFAO)",
      "description": "The text 'lmfa' is an abbreviation for 'laughing my f***ing ass off,' a common internet slang expression used to convey extreme amusement. The meme uses this phrase to signal the author's cruel, mocking intent, implying the joke is meant to be laughed at at the expense of the child.",
