      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The child is mapped as a person who is intellectually disabled and incapable of reading, as described by the text.",
      "description": "The text explicitly refers to the child as 'retard' and claims 'can't even read', directly mapping the visual entity 'child' to the textual description of being intellectually disabled and unable to read. This is a direct analogical mapping where the visual subject is labeled by the text with derogatory attributes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
